     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Questionnaire Ccc.b10-14.symptoms.2m.p</b></p><a name=\"Ccc.b10-14.symptoms.2m.p\"> </a><a name=\"hcCcc.b10-14.symptoms.2m.p\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #fbffeb; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/STU4/StructureDefinition-sdc-questionnaire.html\">SDC Base Questionnaire</a></p></div><b>Structure</b><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"xhtTableBorder1\"><tr class=\"xhtRowBorder2\"><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"The linkID for the item\">LinkID</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Text for the item\">Text</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Minimum and Maximum # of times the item can appear in the instance\">Cardinality</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"The type of the item\">Type</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Other attributes of the item\">Flags</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Additional information about the item\">Description &amp; Constraints</a><span style=\"float: right\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color